# React UI

- Functional components; colocate view helpers near features (`src/sites/`, `src/pages/…`).
- Shell topbar owns the page title — do not duplicate large `page-head` titles on CC/Sites.
- Dense tables: fixed/capped column widths, ellipsis overflow, alarm icon **inside** the Site Name cell (not a far-right column).
- Pagination: icon controls + compact meta; **single horizontal row on mobile** (`flex-wrap: nowrap`).
- Live indicators: client tick (`useLiveNow`) for age-based state; Convex for data push.
- Styles live in `src/styles.css` tokens (graphite / copper / restrained chrome). Avoid purple-AI / neon tropes.
- After UI CSS changes: verify at `max-width: 720px` (and desktop) before reporting done.

```css
/* ❌ BAD — base rule after mobile override undoes nowrap */
@media (max-width: 720px) { .pager { flex-wrap: nowrap; } }
.pager { flex-wrap: wrap; }

/* ✅ GOOD — mobile overrides after base */
.pager { flex-wrap: nowrap; }
@media (max-width: 720px) { .pager { gap: 0.3rem; } }
```
